  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed side extension by reason of the siting and design fails to respect the proportions, massing and detailing of the host dwelling. It would consequently appear out of keeping and character failing to preserve and enhance the Bush Hill Park Conservation Area. The proposal would be contrary to Core Strategy Policies CP30 and CP31, Policies DMD14, DMD37 and DMD44 of the Development Management Document, Policy 7.4 and 7.8 of the London Plan and the NPPF and Bush Hill Park Conservation Area Character Appraisal."
